# Created by https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore/api/rust
# Edit at https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore?templates=rust

### Rust ###
# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug/
target/

# Keep Cargo.lock tracked for reproducible binary/workspace builds

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# End of https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore/api/rust

*.sh
*.txt
*.md
!README.md
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
!doc_gen/**/*.md
!docs/*-2026-11-*.md
# Audit evidence chain (audit H-02 partial mitigation): allow docs/audit/ to be
# tracked. Limitation: this only works because repository .gitignore patterns
# outrank the user-level global ignore of docs/; a global ignore that excludes a
# parent directory cannot be re-included by a pattern for a child path, so in
# some environments 'git add -f docs/audit/...' is still required.
!docs/
!docs/audit/
!docs/audit/**
!docs/**/*-2026-11-*.md
*.bak

fuzz/
**/bench_data/
**/test_shell/
.sisyphus/
.opencode/
.cross-review/
.tmp*
tmp*
logs/
*.log
settings.json
